<section class="gg-page-hero gg-blue-page-hero">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <span class="gg-kicker">About Goal Grower</span>
    <h1>Progress should feel human.</h1>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is built around a simple idea: goals are easier to return to
      when they feel alive, visual, and worth caring for.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-page-section gg-blue-atmosphere">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-split-panel">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Why it exists</span>
        <h2>Most goal apps make growth feel cold.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into plants, so progress
          becomes something you can see instead of another checkbox to forget.
        </p>
        <p>
          The app is designed for real life: imperfect days, fresh starts, shared
          accountability, and slow progress that still matters.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-page-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-grid">
      <div class="gg-support-card">
        <span>Visual</span>
        <h3>Goals become plants</h3>
        <p>Each goal gets a place in your garden and grows through action.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-support-card">
        <span>Gentle</span>
        <h3>Return without shame</h3>
        <p>The app is made to help you come back, not punish you for missing a day.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-support-card">
        <span>Shared</span>
        <h3>Grow together</h3>
        <p>Shared gardens help people support each other while working on their own goals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-page-section gg-blue-atmosphere">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-final-page-panel">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
      <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is still growing too. Testing, feedback, and support help
        shape the app into something useful, beautiful, and motivating.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Become a Tester</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn-soft">Support the Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

